# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Hytale-derived data — NEVER COMMIT
#
# The Hytale EULA v2.2 §3.3 forbids distributing the Game "in whole or in part,
# including its source code, any decryption keys or any other files pertaining to
# the Game", and §4.2 conditions the interoperability exception on not disclosing
# proprietary information. See docs/init/02-DOMAIN.md §Legal.
#
# Generated schemas, extracted corpora, decompiled sources and cached indexes all
# fall under this. They are produced locally, from the user's own installation,
# and stay there.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
local/
# Dev-local source config. In a USER's pack this file is meant to be committed;
# in the tool's own repository it only names paths on one machine.
hytale-atlas.json
*.hytale-cache/
Assets.zip
HytaleServer.jar
**/Schema/*.json

# Node / TypeScript
node_modules/
dist/
build/
out/
*.tsbuildinfo
.npm/
npm-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# Index artifacts
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# Environment and secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Editor / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*~
